  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterMetro1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - Wow. You two are talking.
  - I am talking. Ferret is silent.
  - And?
  - "From your perspective, that probably counts as a \u201Cdialogue,\u201D considering
    you love to demonstrate your glorious talent for ignoring people."
  - "But I\u2019m not answering my husband\u2019s questions about why I\u2019m not
    talking to him. So go ahead and tell him I said: \u201CI don\u2019t talk to traitors.\u201D"
  - "Ignoring people on purpose?\u2026 I\u2026 uh\u2026"
  - "Sir Beast, your\u2026 \u201Cnot-quite-ex-wife-but-kind-of\u201D asked me to
    inform you she\u2019s not speaking to traitors."
  - "Mhm. And you can also tell him that \u201Ctraitors\u201D are those who, instead
    of trying to win their wife back, spend more time chatting with young girls and
    helping them out."
  - "I think I\u2019ll just g\u2014\u2026"
  - "No, Eve, you\u2019re not going anywhere. Ellaina, repeat what you just said. "
  - "Are you saying I\u2019m giving too much attention to a CHILD who can\u2019t
    even cook herself a meal?"
  - "Are you saying that if we had a kid, you\u2019d be jealous of them too?"
  - You need to apologize to the kid for dragging her into OUR mess.
  - "Can I please leave\u2026"
  - "NO. We\u2019re not done! Why should I apologize, when the reason I drag her
    into conflict is YOU?!"
  - Because every time I even come near you, you make that offended face, turn away,
    and ignore me for OVER A MONTH.
  - But the moment a girl young enough to be my daughter asks for HELP, YOU STORM
    IN AND START YELLING AT HER!
  - "THE ONLY ONE YELLING HERE IS YOU, YOU B##@%\u2014!!!"
  - "Oh my god\u2014f #%#\u2026 I\u2019m leaving\u2026."
  - "YOU\u2019RE SUCH AN\u2014 A&%#@#!! AND\u2014 !!!"
  - "FINE! THEN SIT HERE ALONE, YOU\u2014 B#@#*!!!!!"
  - ASAHI!!!!
